            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "হঠাৎ বাতাসে মোমবাতিটা নিভল। Hôṭhāt bātāse mombātiṭā nibhlô. Suddenly the candle went out in the wind."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই আগুন নিভল, sei āgun nibhlô."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The stem vowel rises in the past: নিভল, it went out."
            }
          ]
        },
